This repository uses mixed licensing by component.

Unless a component or file states otherwise, original Nabe source,
documentation and repository tooling use AGPL-3.0-or-later.

The following components use Apache-2.0:
- apps/cli
- apps/speiche
- packages/adguard-adapter
- packages/config
- packages/edge-protocol

Package-level LICENSE files are authoritative for their components.
Third-party material retains its upstream license.

Full license texts:
- LICENSES/AGPL-3.0-or-later.txt
- LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt

See docs/licensing.md for component boundaries.
